{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46890","headline":"贺孙支使郎中迁居 · 齐己","name":"贺孙支使郎中迁居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别认公侯礼上才，筑金何啻旧燕台。\n地连东阁横头买，门对西园正面开。\n不隔红尘趋棨戟，只拖珠履赴尊罍。\n应逢明月清霜夜，闲领笙歌宴此来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}